     "type": "key",
     "style": "retenir",
     "title": "Cameroon in Africa",
     "md": "Cameroon is in **Central Africa**, just north of the Equator, on the Atlantic coast. Its neighbours are Nigeria, Chad, the Central African Republic, the Republic of the Congo, Gabon and Equatorial Guinea. Africa has **many climates and peoples**: deserts in the north, rainforests near the Equator and savannas in between."
    },
