     "title": "Common mistakes",
     "md": "- Thinking that Africa is a country: it is a **continent** with many countries.\n- Saying that all Africa is desert or all Africa is forest.\n- Putting Mount Kilimanjaro in Cameroon: it is in Tanzania.\n- Confusing a continent with an ocean."
    },
